<title>USA: Pacific Scientific sued by shareholders.</title>
<headline>Pacific Scientific sued by shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Scientific Corp shareholders filed a class-action lawsuit against the company Friday, alleging it and certain officials issued false and misleading statements about the company's business prospects, plaintiffs lawyers said.</p>
<p>The suit, filed in the U.S. District Court for the Central District of California, alleges the company and officials including chief executive Edward Brower misled shareholders about the commercial readiness and prospects of the company's Sodium product line.</p>
<p>The suit was filed for shareholders from September 27, 1994 to July 2, 1996, the lawyers said.</p>
